_id":"b-jinshu-080","source_id":"s-jinshu080-ws2603570-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p042","mention_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p042:m0176","quote":"徽之"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-080","source_id":"s-jinshu080-ws2603570-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p042","mention_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p042:m0188","quote":"徽之"}],"id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDCAC","label":"王徽之","status":"active","identity_note":"比較見證晉080來源內人物；完整角色與未定同指資格見source-evidence/jin080-wangxizhi-comparison/ner-dispositions.json，不表示底本已核。","family_path":{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDCA","generation_distance":1,"source_assertion_id":"a-jin080-huizhi-father-xizhi","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-080","source_id":"s-jinshu080-ws2603570-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p001","quote":"王羲之，字逸少，司徒導之從子也。祖正，尚書郎。父曠，淮南太守。元帝之過江也，曠首創其議。羲之幼訥於言，人未之奇。年十三，嘗謁周顗，顗察而異之。時重牛心炙，坐客未啖，顗先割啖羲之，於是始知名。及長，辯贍，以骨鯁稱，尤善隸書，為古今之冠，論者稱其筆勢，以為飄若浮雲，矯若驚龍。深為從伯敦、導所器重。時陳留阮裕有重名，為敦主簿。敦嘗謂羲之曰：「汝是吾家佳子弟，當不減阮主簿。」裕亦目羲之與王承、王悅為王氏三少。時太尉郗鑒使門生求女婿于導，導令就東廂遍觀子弟。門生歸，謂鑒曰：「王氏諸少並佳，然聞信至，咸自矜持。惟一人在東床坦腹食，獨若不聞。」鑒曰：「正此佳婿邪！」訪之，乃羲之也，遂以女妻之。","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p001:m0000"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-080","source_id":"s-jinshu080-ws2603570-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p036","quote":"有七子，知名者五人。玄之早卒。次凝之，亦工草隸，仕歷江州刺史、左將軍、會稽內史。王氏世事張氏五斗米道，凝之彌篤。孫恩之攻會稽，僚佐請為之備。凝之不從，方入靖室請禱，出語諸將佐曰：「吾已請大道，許鬼兵相助，賊自破矣。」既不設備，遂為孫所害。"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-080","source_id":"s-jinshu080-ws2603570-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p037","quote":"徽之字子猷。性卓犖不羈，為大司馬桓溫參軍，蓬首散帶，不綜府事。又為車騎桓沖騎兵參軍，沖問：「卿署何曹？」對曰：「似是馬曹。」又問：「管幾馬？」曰：「不知馬，何由知數！」又問：「馬比死多少？」曰：「未知生，焉知死！」嘗從沖行，值暴雨，徽之因下馬排入車中，謂曰：「公豈得獨擅一車！」沖嘗謂徽之曰：「卿在府日久，比當相料理。」徽之初不酬答，直高視，以手版柱頰云：「西山朝來致有爽氣耳。」","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p037:m0000"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"080既有受驗父子斷言支持同根位置；分支字母不是排行，不補母與其他未知祖先。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}},{"aliases":[{"surface":"楨之","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p039:m0168","c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p040:m0000","c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p040:m0029","c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p040:m0048"]},{"surface":"公幹","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p040:m0003"]},{"surface":"君","mention_ids":["c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p040:m0036"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-080","source_id":"s-jinshu080-ws2603570-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p039","mention_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p039:m0168","quote":"楨之"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-080","source_id":"s-jinshu080-ws2603570-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p040","mention_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p040:m0000","quote":"楨之"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-080","source_id":"s-jinshu080-ws2603570-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p040","mention_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p040:m0003","quote":"公幹"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-080","source_id":"s-jinshu080-ws2603570-comparison","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p040","mention_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-comparison:p040:m0029","quote":"楨之"},{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-080","source_id":"s-jinshu080-ws2603570-comparison","chapter_id":"